  m_text: "Feel free to close the game whenever you need - the town will keep earning
    money while you\u2019re away. Just remember to return regularly:\n\n1 )Repair
    or Upgrade worn-down buildings.\n2) Buy new structures.\n3) Reinvest your profits
    - and watch your $1,000 grow into a highway empire!\n\nGood luck, tycoon - your
    roadside adventure starts now!"
