  m_text: "Earnings:\nEach building produces revenue at set intervals (The green
    indicator above a building). Check its Income value to see how much you\u2019ll
    earn and how often.\n\nDecay & Repair:\nOver time, buildings wear down (The yellow
    indicator above a building). \n\nMonitor the Decay meter:\n-Repair manually to
    restore durability.\n-Upgrade to fully repair and boost future earnings."
